license: "See LICENSE at repository root"
abstract: >
  A self-contained instrument for measuring Counterfactual Echo Gain (CEG) —
  a gate-certified observable that quantifies whether a model-aware time-reversal
  improves state recovery versus a model-blind baseline in a metriplectic
  Klein-Gordon + reaction-diffusion system.
keywords:
  - metriplectic
  - counterfactual echo gain
  - CEG
  - Strang splitting
  - Klein-Gordon
  - reaction-diffusion
  - time-reversal
  - agency
  - VDM
